Zweyter Band.</hi><lb/>
</titlePart>                 </docTitle>                     <milestone rendition="#hr" unit="section"/><lb/>
<byline><hi rendition="#smaller">Mit Kurfu&#x0364;rstl. Sa&#x0364;chs. Privilegium.</hi></byline><lb/>
<milestone rendition="#hr" unit="section"/><lb/>
